@startuml Orchestrator Request Processing
!define CONDITION [condition]
!define EVENT event
!define RESPONSE / response

title Orchestrator (Spring Boot)\nRequest Processing State Machine

[*] --> RequestReceived

state "RequestReceived\nPOST /api/v1/orchestrator/orders" as ReqRecv
state "Validating\n(@Valid check)" as Validate
state "MappingToDomain\n(DTO → BookDetails)" as MapDomain
state "CreatingOrder\n(state=PENDING)" as CreateOrder
state "SavingToDatabase\n(JPA INSERT)" as SaveDB
state "BuildingEvent\n(Kafka payload)" as BuildEvent
state "PublishingToKafka\n(orders.created)" as PubKafka
state "KafkaFailure\n(log warning)" as KafkaFail
state "MarkingOrchestrated\n(PENDING→ORCHESTRATED)" as MarkOrch
state "UpdatingDatabase\n(JPA UPDATE)" as UpdateDB
state "ReturningSuccess\n(201 CREATED)" as Success
state "ValidationError\n(400)" as ValError
state "IllegalArgumentError\n(400)" as IllegalError
state "OrderCreationError\n(500)" as CreateError
state "GenericError\n(500)" as GenError

ReqRecv --> Validate : POST request\n/ controller method invoked\n(OrderIngestController.java:33)

Validate --> MapDomain : Bean validation\n[@NotBlank title, author]\n[@Min(1) pages, quantity]\n[@NotNull coverType, pageType]\n[all constraints pass]\n(CreateOrderRequest.java:20-27)

Validate --> ValError : Bean validation\n[any @Valid constraint fails]\n/ throw MethodArgumentNotValidException

MapDomain --> CreateOrder : Convert DTO\n/ ApiOrderMapper.toDomain(request)\n/ create BookDetails\n/ calculate estimatedCost\n(ApiOrderMapper.java:18-26)

CreateOrder --> SaveDB : Create entity\n/ ProductionOrder.createOrder(bookDetails)\n/ set state=PENDING\n/ set createdAt=now()\n(ProductionOrder.java:52-53)

SaveDB --> BuildEvent : Persist\n/ orderRepository.save(order)\n/ JPA INSERT\n/ generate ID\n(OrderOrchestrationService.java:36)

BuildEvent --> PubKafka : Map to event\n/ OrderEventPayloadMapper.buildOrderCreatedEvent()\n/ create JSON: {order_id, timestamp,\n  status:"pending", books:{...}, ack_required:true}\n(OrderEventPayloadMapper.java:40-58)

PubKafka --> MarkOrch : Publish event\n[Kafka available]\n/ kafkaTemplate.send("orders.created", orderId, JSON)\n/ logger.info("event published")\n(OrderOrchestrationService.java:43-44)

PubKafka --> KafkaFail : Kafka failure\n[Kafka down || serialization error]\n/ catch Exception\n(KafkaEventPublisher.java:30-33)

KafkaFail --> MarkOrch : Log warning\n/ logger.warn("Kafka not available...")\n/ CONTINUE execution (fail-open)\n(OrderOrchestrationService.java:45-47)

MarkOrch --> UpdateDB : State transition\n[currentState == PENDING]\n/ savedOrder.markAsOrchestrated()\n/ set state=ORCHESTRATED\n/ set orchestratedAt=now()\n(ProductionOrder.java:56-64)

MarkOrch --> IllegalError : State validation fails\n[currentState != PENDING]\n/ throw IllegalStateException\n"Kan kun orkestrere orders i PENDING state"

UpdateDB --> Success : Persist state\n/ orderRepository.save(savedOrder)\n/ JPA UPDATE\n(OrderOrchestrationService.java:50)

Success --> [*] : Build response\n/ ApiOrderMapper.toResponse(order)\n/ return 201 CREATED\n{\n  "orderId": 123,\n  "state": "ORCHESTRATED",\n  "createdAt": ISO-8601\n}\n(OrderIngestController.java:40-43)

ValError --> [*] : Exception handler\n/ @ExceptionHandler(MethodArgumentNotValidException)\n/ return 400 BAD_REQUEST\n{\n  "error": "Validation Failed",\n  "timestamp": ISO-8601,\n  "errors": {"field": "message"}\n}\n(OrderIngestController.java:69-84)

IllegalError --> [*] : Exception handler\n/ @ExceptionHandler(IllegalArgumentException)\n/ return 400 BAD_REQUEST\n{\n  "error": "Invalid Request",\n  "message": "...",\n  "timestamp": ISO-8601\n}\n(OrderIngestController.java:86-97)

CreateOrder --> CreateError : Exception\n[any RuntimeException]
SaveDB --> CreateError : Exception\n[any RuntimeException]
BuildEvent --> CreateError : Exception\n[any RuntimeException]

CreateError --> [*] : Exception handler\n/ @ExceptionHandler(OrderCreationException)\n/ return 500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR\n{\n  "error": "Order Creation Failed",\n  "message": "...",\n  "timestamp": ISO-8601\n}\n(OrderIngestController.java:99-110)

CreateError --> GenError : Unexpected exception
GenError --> [*] : Exception handler\n/ @ExceptionHandler(Exception)\n/ return 500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR\n(OrderIngestController.java:112-123)

note right of PubKafka
  DESIGN CHOICE: Kafka failure
  does NOT block order creation.
  System continues with warning.
  Order marked ORCHESTRATED even
  if event not published.

  Risk: BookScheduler may miss
  orders if Kafka is down.
end note

note bottom of MarkOrch
  Transaction boundary:
  @Transactional on createOrder()
  (OrderOrchestrationService.java:30)

  If markAsOrchestrated() throws,
  entire transaction rolls back.
end note

@enduml
